          "text": "Paint 3D\n3D Generator\nFeatures\nFAQ\nEnglish\nFree\n✨ Free AI image-to-3D — upload any image, get a 3D model\nCreate 3D Content Online with Paint 3D\n\nPaint 3D turns any image into a detailed 3D model. Upload a photo, generate in seconds, download a GLB file ready for games, 3D printing, or product visualization.\nFree. No signup. No install.\n\nTry Paint 3D Free\nPaint 3D — Image to 3D Generator\n\nUpload an image, generate a 3D model, download the GLB file. First generation may take 30 to 60 seconds while the GPU warms up.\n\nSee What Paint 3D Can Create\n\nPaint 3D reads the shape, color, and texture of an"
